<section class="section" id="faq">
  <div class="container text-center">
    <span class="section-label">Common Questions</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">Quick answers to what you're probably wondering.</h2>
    <div class="faq-list" style="text-align:left;">

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-btn" aria-expanded="false">
          How does the monthly plan work — is there a catch?
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <div class="faq-answer-inner">No catch. You sign a simple service agreement and make your first monthly payment of $175. We get to work immediately. No large design deposit, no $3,000–$5,000 up front like a traditional agency. The 12-month minimum means we both commit to the relationship — it's how we can invest real time building your site for just $175/month. After 12 months, it's month-to-month and you can cancel anytime.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-btn" aria-expanded="false">
          Do I own my website?
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <div class="faq-answer-inner">With the monthly subscription, we own the code and host it for you — that's how we can build a professional site with no large design deposit up front. Think of it like leasing a storefront: you get all the benefits without the upfront capital. Want to own the site outright? We offer a lump-sum option — ask us about it. After purchase, we can still handle hosting and maintenance for a small monthly fee.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-btn" aria-expanded="false">
          Why not just use WordPress or Wix?
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <div class="faq-answer-inner">WordPress is the #1 target for hackers on the internet, requires constant maintenance, and its page builders produce slow, bloated code. Wix and Squarespace are better for absolute beginners, but you sacrifice speed, uniqueness, and SEO performance. We hand-code every website from scratch — the result is faster, more secure, completely unique to your business, and scores high on Google PageSpeed Insights. Your competitors are on WordPress. You won't be.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-btn" aria-expanded="false">
          How long does it take to build my site?
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <div class="faq-answer-inner">Most sites are designed, built, and launched within 2–3 weeks. We start with a discovery call to learn about your business, then present a design for your approval. Once you sign off, we finalize the build and launch. The faster you can get us your content (logo, photos, text), the faster we can get you live.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-btn" aria-expanded="false">
          What if I need changes after the site launches?
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <div class="faq-answer-inner">Unlimited updates are included in your monthly fee — always. Need to change your business hours, add a new service, update your team photos, or add a blog post? Just reach out. We'll take care of it, usually within one business day. There's no nickel-and-diming for small changes.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
